{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "69e4d770fe9c670b8105378c182a1a9f16e951ad00b585baa24f6bed39a4e477", "ja": "（紬がこだわりを詰め込んでプロデュースした服の\n試作品が届いた。今は試着をしてもらっている）", "zh": "（倾注了纺诸多讲究制作的服装样衣送到了。现在正让她试穿）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "437054c62636eb1daf8d8ee9b0f079491ab40f04964f469b965b98e3b4f9fbcd", "ja": "素敵な仕上がりですね。これならば、\nかしこまった場所にも着ていけそうです。", "zh": "成品真漂亮呢。这样的话，穿去正式的场合也没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7ea7ea4b807fa1c3e3e10af6788090966d74d54c5c510b7d0a8f5aba1c5c2e31", "ja": "そうだな。清楚さもあり、可愛らしさもある。\n紬みたいな服になったな。", "zh": "是啊。既有清纯感，又很可爱。做成了像紬一样的服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e573f689f2e3b1ea2b547adae179b3184732e2f45aa5e6ee18304305152c25bd", "ja": "め、面と向かって褒められると、\n少々恥ずかしいですが……ありがとうございます。", "zh": "当、当面被您夸奖，\n还是会有点害羞……谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0f0d16c350739f5ff25f50757f8ef1c5c831118e2c21e85a6ee56ef60c327269", "ja": "そのように言っていただけると、\nこの服に使った着物も喜んでいると思います。", "zh": "您能这样说的话，我觉得用在这件衣服上的和服也会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4dd9acaf545db3385a789219f6568db783fde6e57ca1849d055075db405c0e49", "ja": "着られなくなった着物を活用する……。\n紬らしい、素敵なアイディアだな！", "zh": "把穿不了了的和服重新利用起来……真是很有紬风格的绝妙主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "294162e7f551553ecf8a9d4aed1d9191871a5abfa62fe82d3f0df6347cac94ae", "ja": "……そう褒めてくださいますが、\n着物の再利用は珍しい取り組みではありません。", "zh": "……承蒙您这般夸奖，\n不过和服的再利用并不是什么少见的新鲜事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6c3a869616fff0bcbad19390258116b62a8659fd2e7b578c359cd30267b8e5c2", "ja": "古い着物を巾着にしたり、ワンピースやドレスに\nリメイクする人は多いんですよ。", "zh": "把旧和服做成小布袋，或者改造成连衣裙、礼服的人也很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5038db3599b546057a35eb95a120ddf074af75c18b72fda9acd9263df1973709", "ja": "へえ……。みんな、今の時代に合った形で\n着物を楽しんでるってことだな。", "zh": "哦……大家都在以符合现代潮流的方式享受和服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fecc1d5a6f755c49b9cb717684741d4d0cb04459661a36f228301a8ef4039ac9", "ja": "ええ。ですから、この服も……\n一部ではありますが、古い着物を使用したのです。", "zh": "是的。所以，这身服装……虽然只是一部分，但用到了古老的和服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a83310ba27f947f4958c0986ede38f6989b1422e10b59c013582951dfdc64ed9", "ja": "じゃあ、紬のこだわった部分っていうのは……。", "zh": "那么，紬特别讲究的部分是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f062bba8309e3e6b0b023ba5246941070bd33c5511f5e679281a98100d1396f2", "ja": "はい。プロのデザイナーさんを相手に、少し……\n口を出しすぎてしまったかもと思いましたが。", "zh": "是的。面对专业设计师，\n我想自己或许有些干涉过多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cdeb55eb2e44919f8a685074ee67114dd4cd3395a968ecc444cda3958a2a1edf", "ja": "せっかく着物が新たな服に生まれ変わるのですから、\n中途半端なものにはしたくなかったので……。", "zh": "难得能让和服重获新生，变成全新的服装……我不想做出半吊子的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1106ebf3fab0b5a0b869c1ec996bf69220591e2d8f20f5255c81c2ee9b079327", "ja": "なるほどな。子どもの頃から着物に触れてきた\n紬だからこそ感じる思いだな。", "zh": "原来如此。正因为紬从小就接触和服，才能体会到这样的心情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "172c327ff9b868445819830c2a763bdad297f6b1b5f83079a0c2e9dd3c8bcd82", "ja": "そうですね。これまで、お着物を大切にしている方を\nたくさん見てきました。", "zh": "是啊。我见过许多珍惜和服的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bb5f13f830c15e7f7d729081d48af3d76b958a9ea9f32da9f8dececd96dd724b", "ja": "残念ながら……形がある以上、\nいつまでも着続けられるわけではありません。", "zh": "可惜……既然是有形之物，就不可能一直穿下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55e80ddb9cb33d496ef20ffb215dbc7af5dbb4c35f56472e8c662b146ab9dcfc", "ja": "だからこそ、大切な思いだけでも絶やさず、\n残すことができれば……そう思ったのです。", "zh": "正因为如此，我才觉得，即使只是珍贵的心意，也能一直延续下去，并将它保留下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a2897b13581a3a223afdd88f1e0fe7213319d828f78782a62b9afde12d00651d", "ja": "そうだな。たとえ形は変わっても、\n着物を見る度に、当時のことを思い出すと思う。", "zh": "是啊。即使形式发生了改变，\n每当看到这件和服，我想还是会想起当时的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fd1952de17927d664f0b827c12b447b0e86aec85863b25bb0a8cd63a19d096e7", "ja": "着物に込められた思いも、紬の思いも……\nこうして新しい形になって、続いていくんだな。", "zh": "寄托在和服中的心意，还有紬的心意……都会这样以新的形式延续下去啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d29d4ce9a2fc4b8d3f76441e35469dac07a7b12311790507194d7af66bc4203a", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがとうございます。\n着物について考える機会をいただけて、嬉しいです。", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢您。\n能有机会思考和服相关的事情，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0444_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "dd65c3f0da6ec33fce78eda2b2a1ad11d189b3fc2d7a8459ca24083a45f85940", "ja": "私なりに、思いを紡ぐ手助けができたのであれば。\n……こんなに誇らしいことはありませんね。ふふっ。", "zh": "如果我能以自己的方式，帮您编织心意的话……没有什么比这更让我自豪了。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
